			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Coordinate Cocoon webview IPC and Maintain gitmodules fixes\n\nUpdate two Land submodules with complementary improvements:\n\nCocoon: Implement actual gRPC notifications in WindowService's IPC proxy\nto complete the webview lifecycle integration with Mountain backend. SendNotification\nnow posts messages via webview.postMessage, SendRequest returns undefined as\nfire-and-forget, and dispose callback notifies Mountain to destroy the webview\npanel via webview.dispose.\n\nMaintain: Fix .gitmodules formatting by removing incorrect indentation from the\nDocumentation/Rust submodule entry and add ignore=all directive to prevent local\nsubmodule modifications from cluttering git status.\n\nThis coordinated update completes the webview lifecycle IPC while keeping the\nMaintain workspace clean.",
			"SHA": "664d25f1c09f11757bfc579195ac020d189b6ec2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T04:07:13Z",
			"File": [
				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				5
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate POSIX shell compliance across Land submodules\n\nUpdate five submodules to use POSIX-compliant sh shebang instead of bash in build scripts:\n- Output: Make shell scripts POSIX-compliant (prepublishOnly.sh, Run.sh)\n- Rest: Convert bash-specific scripts to portable POSIX sh syntax\n- Wind: Use POSIX sh shebang for build scripts\n- Worker: Use POSIX-compliant sh shebang in build scripts\n- Cocoon: Implement progress IPC notifications to Mountain\n\nThe Cocoon submodule also includes a new feature: implementing actual gRPC notifications for the WithProgress API, enabling Mountain backend to display real-time progress indicators during extension execution.\n\nThis coordinated update ensures consistent shell compatibility across the Land ecosystem while adding the progress notification capability to the extension host.",
			"SHA": "dc77d54e7ce0cd5d655a5a489364e659958226de"
		},
